Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "IN",
    "trade": "handloom cotton scarves",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "USD"
  },
  "hinglish": true,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "missing",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "Mira, 10:12: Hi, mujhe do handloom cotton scarves chahiye, indigo wale. Can you send them to me outside India?\nKiran, 10:14: Haan, two indigo handloom cotton scarves are available. Total USD 48, shipping included.\nMira, 10:16: Perfect. Main PayPal se USD 48 pay karungi. Please pack both scarves together.\nKiran, 10:18: Done. I’ll send you the invoice and the courier tracking details after booking.\nMira, 10:20: Thank you! Plain wrapping is fine; gift note nahi chahiye.\nKiran, 10:22: Bilkul, plain wrapping and no note. I’ll book the parcel once payment is received."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller's invoice",
      "text": "Invoice\nSeller: Kiran, India\nBuyer: Mira\n\nTwo indigo handloom cotton scarves: 2 x USD 20 = USD 40\nInternational shipping: USD 8\nTotal due: USD 48\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe scarves will be packed together in plain wrapping, with no gift note. The quoted shipping charge covers the courier booking for this order. Tracking details will be shared with the buyer after the parcel is booked. Please check that the item description and total match our chat before paying. Thank you for your order."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier booking receipt",
      "text": "Courier booking receipt\nCarrier: DHL Express\nSender: Kiran, India\nRecipient: Mira\nContents: two cotton scarves\nTracking number: JX7K4M9P2Q6R\nService: international parcel\n\nThe sender requested plain wrapping and confirmed that both scarves are packed together. This is a booking receipt, not proof of delivery. The parcel has not yet been handed over to the carrier; consequently, no dispatch date is available. The sender can share the tracking number with the recipient after handover. Delivery timing will depend on the destination and customs processing."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: USD 48",
      "value": "USD 48"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: two indigo handloom cotton scarves",
      "value": "two indigo handloom cotton scarves"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: dispatch date of the parcel",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Mira",
      "value": "Mira"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking_number: JX7K4M9P2Q6R",
      "value": "JX7K4M9P2Q6R"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: DHL Express",
      "value": "DHL Express"
    }
  ]
}
